    {
      "text": "至多三人协调能力并共享装置，但也可为个人收益脱离队伍",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Descend solo or with up to two friends into the dangerous depths of PAIMO. Coordinate your abilities, share gadgets, and work together to survive. But watch your back... sometimes you’ll need to unleash your inner Renegade and break away from the group to maximize your rewards.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3227240/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "把装置、武器与终极技能组合成改变战斗方式的独特协同",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Combining Gadgets, Weapons, and Ultimates creates unique synergies that will shape your descent into PAIMO.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3227240/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "越深入矿脉风险与收益越高，必须判断何时把矿物送回飞船兑换永久成长",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "The deeper you descend, the greater the rewards and the risks. Collect valuable minerals and trade them for permanent upgrades, but choose wisely when to send them back to your ship.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3227240/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
